OL,3,AThieves steal 600-diamond necklace from
OL,4,AVienna museum in broad daylight
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn international manhunt is under way
OL,7,Ffor two men who stole a necklace
OL,8,Fdecorated with more than 600 diamonds
OL,9,Ffrom a museum in Vienna after buying a
OL,10,Fticket for the exhibition in which it
OL,11,Fwas being displayed.
OL,13,FPolice said the two suspects smashed a
OL,14,Fglass display case at the Vienna Museum
OL,15,Fof Applied Arts (MAK) on Thursday
OL,16,Fafternoon and grabbed the platinum and
OL,17,Fdiamond necklace, which is believed to
OL,18,Fbe worth more than $4m (#3m; bB,3.5m).
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
