OL,3,AThieves steal 600-diamond necklace from
OL,4,AVienna museum in broad daylight
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe necklace, which was designed for
OL,7,Fthe former Egyptian royal family, was
OL,8,Fpart of an exhibition on the jewellers
OL,9,FVan Cleef & Arpels, due to run at MAK
OL,10,Funtil September.
OL,12,FThe theft is the latest in a series of
OL,13,Fspectacular heists of artefacts at
OL,14,FEuropean museums.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
